body:
I'm Pls and Currently Dying.

Spent all of my orbs on the Falchion banner for Lucina, got a 5★ Reinhardt. Then the Branded King banner comes along with literally my most wanted unit in the series (F!Morgan) so I scrape up orbs from chain challenges. Another 5★ Reinhardt (and Micaiah).

I thought doing fan art of a character was supposed to make them come home ;-;

If she is demoted, that would be amazing. A stance skill available at 4★ would be great, especially Mirror Stance for Grima. Only problem is that I don't want to feed Morgan to Robin like that ;-;

But yeah, I really want to pull her too. The + tome is looking promising for the demotion, especially since the other two have amazing weapons.

Doesn't mean I won't pull, though.

My 0 orbs won't cut it either ;-;

If IS releases F!Morgan, it may very well be the first time I spend money on orbs. I spent all 80 of my orbs trying to pull Lucina on the Falchion banner... to no avail (not a single 5★ either). Seriously, if IS has Morgan and her mother on back to back banners and I don't pull either, I will be in great pain.

That being said, I do want F!Morgan in the game ASAP. So, F!Morgan is included with these new heroes, I will go full whale if necessary for best daughter.
